### Implementation Details:
**Main Invoices Screen Infinite Scroll:**
- Replaced traditional pagination with infinite scroll for smoother browsing
- Added AJAX endpoint `load_more_invoices()` in Invoices controller
- Automatic loading when user scrolls within 200px of bottom
- Manual "Load More" button as fallback
- Shows loading spinner and "No more invoices" message at end
- Loads 20 invoices per request
- Works seamlessly with existing status filters (All, Draft, Sent, Viewed, Paid, Overdue)
- Works seamlessly with search functionality
- Maintains checkbox selections and batch operations across dynamically loaded content
- Uses proper CSRF token handling for AJAX requests
- Renders complete invoice rows with all options (edit, PDF, email, payment, Bill.com, delete)
- Preserves Bill.com status indicators on dynamically loaded invoices
- Hidden pagination controls (still exist for compatibility but not visible)

**Client > Payments Tab Infinite Scroll:**
- Added AJAX endpoint `load_more_payments()` in Clients/Ajax controller
- Automatic loading when user scrolls within 500px of bottom
- Manual "Load More" button as fallback
- Shows loading spinner and "No more payments" message at end
- Loads 20 payments per request
- Renders complete payment rows with all options (edit, delete)
- Hidden pagination controls for payments tab

**Main Payments Screen Infinite Scroll:**
- Added AJAX endpoint `load_more_payments()` in Payments controller
- Automatic loading when user scrolls within 200px of bottom
- Manual "Load More" button as fallback
- Shows loading spinner and "No more payments" message at end
- Loads 20 payments per request
- Renders complete payment rows with all options (edit, delete)
- Hidden pagination controls

